<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian Airlines 1996 pretax surges.</title>
<headline>Austrian Airlines 1996 pretax surges.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian Airlines said on Tuesday 1996 group pretax profit rose to 177 million schillings from 64.9 million a year ago as passenger volumes increased 7.6 percent to 3.5 million.</p>
<p>In a statement released ahead of its earnings news conference, the flag carrier said total freight volume increased 2.2 percent to 63,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>Looking ahead, the group said positive developments continued in the first quarter of the current year, when passenger volume rose 9.3 percent to almost 690,000.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
